   I.USES

     This machine is used for shearing and braking low-carbon plates(
mild steel)of other metal materials which have the same intensity as the
low-carbon plate,but their maximum thickmess is Imm,It can also be
used for rolling' the low-carbon plate(mild steel)or other metal materials
which has the same intensity as the low-carbon plate,its maximum
thickness is 1mm.

